#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:1
#: cfc308b50d8a431fadbf45b77a15ce6a
msgid "最大误差结构：先复核，再决定删不删"
msgstr "Largest-Error Structures: Inspect Before Deleting"

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:3
#: cdd30287f73a40759dea0b1eada18974
msgid ""
"`Find Max Error Point` "
"用来快速定位当前图上误差最大的结构。高误差不等于坏数据：它也可能表示训练集缺少这一类结构。正确顺序是先选中、看结构和 "
"`Config_type`，再决定重新计算、保留补强或删除。"
msgstr ""
"`Find Max Error Point` quickly locates the structures with the largest errors "
"on the current plot. A large error does not necessarily mean bad data; it may "
"show that the training set lacks this type of structure. Select the points, "
"inspect the structures and `Config_type`, then decide whether to recalculate, "
"retain and reinforce, or delete them."

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:5
#: 994dbd0d88084f64bc227754a35369ba
msgid "1. 先激活要检查的图"
msgstr "1. Activate the plot you want to inspect"

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:7
#: 4a5dba654d804a928f539b8fd361f7b9
msgid "打开训练结果后，双击要检查的小图，使它进入主图区。本例检查 `energy`；如果要找力误差最大的结构，应先激活 `force` 图。"
msgstr "After opening the training results, double-click the thumbnail you want to inspect so it enters the main plot. This example checks `energy`; to find the structures with the largest force errors, activate the `force` plot first."

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:9
#: 00a5f9d35a0b41dab2471926f3bbfa2b
msgid "激活能量图并打开最大误差筛选"
msgstr "Activate the energy plot and open the largest-error selector"

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:9
#: 00a5f9d35a0b41dab2471926f3bbfa2b
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/max_error_review_entry.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/max_error_review_entry.png"

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:14
#: 49fa3544eea8497fa4be05a4776da956
msgid ""
"点击 `Find Max Error Point`。这个按钮只针对当前主图，不会同时混合 energy、force、stress 和 virial"
" 的误差。"
msgstr ""
"Click `Find Max Error Point`. This action applies only to the current main "
"plot; it does not combine errors from energy, force, stress, and virial."

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:16
#: 1d64639a15f74d04a8bdad4de369c7f5
msgid "2. 输入要复核的结构数"
msgstr "2. Enter the number of structures to review"

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:18
#: 31222b19174f4510829d739e8a0881ca
msgid "最大误差结构数量设置"
msgstr "Number of largest-error structures to select"

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:18
#: 31222b19174f4510829d739e8a0881ca
msgid ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_maxerr_dialog.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_maxerr_dialog.png"

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:23
#: d63f75a4349143a0aaaec953d4551c0f
msgid "第一次可以先填 `5`。数量太大时容易失去重点；先看最极端的几个，确认问题类型后再扩大范围。"
msgstr "Start with `5`. A large selection makes it harder to focus. Review the most extreme cases first, identify the problem type, and then expand the selection if needed."

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:25
#: efa210a70ebe4bcb984aa1a507854968
msgid "3. 逐个判断误差来源"
msgstr "3. Determine the source of each error"

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:27
#: 0f18ae8b824c4f4c965ba07328665d6d
msgid "选中的五个最大能量误差结构"
msgstr "Five selected structures with the largest energy errors"

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:27
#: 0f18ae8b824c4f4c965ba07328665d6d
msgid ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/tutorials/max_error_review_result.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/tutorials/max_error_review_result.png"

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:32
#: 484e15a14ec2465c8a09d774e68bf45f
msgid "本例底部状态栏显示 `Sel: 5`。依次点击选中点，重点看右侧结构、`Config_type` 和原始文件序号："
msgstr "The status bar in this example shows `Sel: 5`. Click the selected points one by one and inspect the structure on the right, its `Config_type`, and its source-file index:"

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:34
#: 2bbcdd10af734323b3dacc7f9ecdeb60
msgid "结构合理、标签可信：通常应保留，并检查这一类构型是否在训练集中覆盖不足；"
msgstr "Reasonable structure and trustworthy label: usually retain it and check whether this configuration type is underrepresented in the training set."

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:35
#: 6643267190364cf9aeb62bdec89c0aa3
msgid "结构合理但 DFT 未收敛或标签异常：回到原计算重新检查，不要直接拿去重训；"
msgstr "Reasonable structure but unconverged DFT or an abnormal label: return to the original calculation and inspect it; do not use it directly for retraining."

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:36
#: 7c6647f8153a4145b09badc530a6f8c7
msgid "结构明显破坏、原子重叠或来源错误：确认后再删除，或者先 `Export Selected` 单独留档。"
msgstr "Clearly broken structure, overlapping atoms, or incorrect provenance: delete it only after confirmation, or use `Export Selected` to archive it separately first."

#: ../../source/example/maximum-error-review.md:38
#: e815a987f99c4257a7710215140ab8f2
msgid "不要把“删除最大误差点”当成降低 RMSE 的固定步骤。未经复核地删除，可能正好删掉模型最需要补学的区域。"
msgstr "Do not treat deleting the largest-error points as a routine way to reduce RMSE. Deleting them without review may remove exactly the region the model most needs to learn."
